.git
**/node_modules
# The image builds its own bundle in the web stage; a host build in the context
# would be copied in by `COPY . .` and then overwritten, for no purpose.
internal/admin/dist
web/dist
# Secrets and live state. None of these belong in an image layer, and a build
# context that carries them is one `COPY . .` away from shipping them.
.env*
.uat-credentials
data/
data-backup/
*.db*
# Host build outputs and local tooling state.
darkrouter
darkrouter.exe
presetgen
.playwright-mcp/
.agents/
.codex/
docs/
providers.png
